{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":93647,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793461863058,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2019,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jFRL99eGNl9ygXgt3aJbiTXexo5.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1930365","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"中学生の頃、凶悪犯罪組織「ナイン」によるテロ事件に巻き込まれた七月清司は、一人の警官に命を救われる。事件から9年が経ち、命の恩人である警官に憧れ、自らも警官となった。\n\nある非番の日に、銀行強盗の現場に居合わせた七月は、そこで同じく警官だと言う一ノ瀬栞に出会う。\n\nこの日を境に、七月の人生は大きく変わることになるのだった――。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-10-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xcU2Ynvgl1eKQKaHJ18i2X1uHGd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xcU2Ynvgl1eKQKaHJ18i2X1uHGd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/93647/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1947170","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Nanatsuki's first case with Special 7 is the murder of four politicians in a single night! Could an angry blog post hold the key to the mystery?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-10-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dOnMBiu4Qjnh5Vgd0jJfHYhu4Ey.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dOnMBiu4Qjnh5Vgd0jJfHYhu4Ey.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/93647/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"1947171","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A notorious bomber threatens three skyscrapers and Special 7 will have to stop them without backup! Could there be anything to the rumors that the bomber uses the ancient super-technology known as \"magic\"?","lan