 rescue the hostages and prevent Nine's ritual? And what are Warlock and his mysterious second-in-command really after?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-11-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zagfoCivTtzOki30AdO5AznFFee.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zagfoCivTtzOki30AdO5AznFFee.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/93647/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1947175","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After their close call with a dragon, Special 7 takes a day off. While most of the unit spends time with friends and family, Kiryuin takes Nanatsuki to the grave of a former member. Nijo, meanwhile, is on the verge of a shocking revelation.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-11-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lwniBMAGCG2nsDSk9KMejldxIYl.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lwniBMAGCG2nsDSk9KMejldxIYl.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/93647/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1947176","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Bellemer is kidnapped off the street! The rest of Special 7 searches for her, but every possible lead seems to be a dead end. Will they be able to find Bellemer, and will she be able to survive long enough to give them the chance?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-11-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fXVGmAN2pwKAUqrlCLHPcAkl06k.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fXVGmAN2pwKAUqrlCLHPcAkl06k.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/93647/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"1947177","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"